<BaseLayout title="Richmond"> 

  <!-- ======================================================
    HERO — the big image + text at the top of the page
  ======================================================= -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-grid">

      <div class="hero-image">
        <img
          src="https://images.kroppix.com/road/richmond/richmond-sunset-corellas.jpg"
          alt="Richmond free campsite at sunset"
          title="View from Charters Towers hill"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="hero-copy">
        <h1>Richmond</h1>

        <!-- One or two sentences about this place/journey -->
        <p>Richmond sits in the middle of western Queensland, about three hours inland from Charters Towers on the Flinders Highway. It's a small town by any measure, but it sits on top of something remarkable — the bed of an ancient inland sea that covered this part of Australia roughly 100 million years ago. What's left of that sea is now slowly coming out of the ground.</p> <!-- CHANGE THIS -->

        <!-- DELETE the second <p> if you only want one paragraph -->
        <p>We stopped here as part of the inland run, and it turned out to be one of the better decisions of the trip. The fossicking site is free and open — you just turn up, dig, and see what the ground gives you. The kids found belemnites within the first ten minutes. That changes the pace of a day considerably</p>
        
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ======================================================
    GALLERY SECTION — copy this block for each section
    Delete sections you don't need
  ======================================================= -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2>Dirt, dust and bones</h2> <!-- CHANGE THIS -->
      <p>A copule of days spent digging for fossils.</p> <!-- CHANGE THIS or delete this line -->
    </div>

    <div class="gallery-grid">
      {sectionOne.map(photo => <GalleryCard {...photo} />)} <!-- CHANGE sectionOne to match your array name -->
    </div>
  </section>


</BaseLayout>